# Force git/GitHub to render source files as textual diffs even if a stray
# control byte would otherwise trip binary auto-detection. (A literal NUL in
# src/memory/index.ts once made the whole file show as "Binary file not
# shown" on GitHub — see #317/#318.) The `diff` attribute only affects diff
# rendering; it does not normalize line endings, so it introduces no churn.
*.ts   diff
*.tsx  diff
*.js   diff
*.jsx  diff
*.json diff
*.md   diff
